    "A private window into your recovery, sleep and strain — read straight from your strap, kept only on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "A private window into your recovery, sleep and strain — read straight from your strap, kept only on this Mac." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Ein privater Blick auf deine Erholung, deinen Schlaf und deine Belastung — direkt vom Strap gelesen und nur auf diesem Mac gespeichert." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Una ventana privada a tu recuperación, sueño y esfuerzo — leído directamente de tu pulsera, guardado solo en este Mac." } }
      }
    },
    "A standalone companion for your WHOOP. Everything stays on this device — your history, your live stream, your numbers. Nothing is uploaded. NOOP is an independent, experimental project, not the WHOOP app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "A standalone companion for your WHOOP. Everything stays on this device — your history, your live stream, your numbers. Nothing is uploaded. NOOP is an independent, experimental project, not the WHOOP app." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Ein eigenständiger Begleiter für dein WHOOP. Alles bleibt auf diesem Gerät — deine Historie, dein Live-Stream, deine Werte. Nichts wird hochgeladen. NOOP ist ein unabhängiges, experimentelles Projekt, nicht die WHOOP-App." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Un compañero independiente para tu WHOOP. Todo se queda en este dispositivo — tu historial, tu transmisión en vivo, tus métricas. Nada se sube a la nube. NOOP es un proyecto independiente y experimental, no la app oficial de WHOOP." } }
      }
    },
