    "I keep this project anonymous, so crypto is the only way to chip in — no Patreon, no PayPal, no name attached. Quick, global, and private for both of us.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "I keep this project anonymous, so crypto is the only way to chip in — no Patreon, no PayPal, no name attached. Quick, global, and private for both of us." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Ich halte dieses Projekt anonym, daher ist Krypto die einzige Möglichkeit, beizutragen — kein Patreon, kein PayPal, kein Name. Schnell, weltweit und privat für uns beide." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Mantengo este proyecto en el anonimato, así que las criptomonedas son la única forma de aportar — sin Patreon, sin PayPal, sin nombres. Rápido, global y privado para ambos." } }
      }
    },
    "Import your history first. A WHOOP export in Data Sources fills every metric you can explore here in about a minute.": {
