      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "No stress history yet. Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources to see it." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Noch kein Stressverlauf. Importiere deinen WHOOP-Export unter Datenquellen, um ihn zu sehen." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Aún no hay historial de estrés. Importa tu exportación de WHOOP en Orígenes de datos para verlo." } }
      }
    },
    "No workouts yet. They come from your WHOOP and Apple Health history. Import in Data Sources to bring them in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "No workouts yet. They come from your WHOOP and Apple Health history. Import in Data Sources to bring them in." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Noch keine Workouts. Sie stammen aus deinem WHOOP- und Apple-Health-Verlauf. Importiere sie unter Datenquellen." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Aún no hay entrenamientos. Provienen de tu historial de WHOOP y Apple Health. Importa en Orígenes de datos para añadirlos." } }
      }
    },
    "Non-binary": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Non-binary" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Nichtbinär" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "No binario" } }
      }
    },
    "NOOP": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP" } }
      }
    },
    "NOOP — all your data, none of the cloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP — all your data, none of the cloud." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP — all deine Daten, nichts in der Cloud." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP — todos tus datos, nada en la nube." } }
      }
    },
    "NOOP %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP %@" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP %@" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP %@" } }
      }
    },
    "NOOP is free and always will be, nothing is locked. It cost real money and a lot of unpaid hours to build, and there's a Windows app, an Android app and an iOS app I want to ship next. If it's useful to you and you want to help with the development and testing costs, even a few quid in crypto genuinely keeps it moving, and honestly it keeps me motivated to keep building.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP is free and always will be, nothing is locked. It cost real money and a lot of unpaid hours to build, and there's a Windows app, an Android app and an iOS app I want to ship next. If it's useful to you and you want to help with the development and testing costs, even a few quid in crypto genuinely keeps it moving, and honestly it keeps me motivated to keep building." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP ist kostenlos und bleibt es, nichts ist gesperrt. Es hat echtes Geld und viele unbezahlte Stunden gekostet, und es gibt eine Windows-App, eine Android-App und eine iOS-App, die ich als Nächstes veröffentlichen möchte. Wenn es dir nützt und du bei den Entwicklungs- und Testkosten helfen möchtest, hält es schon mit ein paar Euro in Krypto wirklich am Laufen — und ehrlich gesagt motiviert es mich, weiterzubauen." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP es gratis y siempre lo será, no hay nada bloqueado. Ha costado dinero real y muchas horas no remuneradas crearlo, y mi idea es lanzar próximamente versiones para Windows, Android e iOS. Si te resulta útil y quieres echar una mano con los gastos de desarrollo y pruebas, cualquier pequeña aportación en cripto ayuda a mantener el proyecto vivo y, sinceramente, me motiva a seguir programando." } }
      }
    },
    "NOOP is not a medical device. It is for informational and personal-insight purposes only and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any condition. Talk to a clinician for medical advice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP is not a medical device. It is for informational and personal-insight purposes only and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any condition. Talk to a clinician for medical advice." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP ist kein medizinisches Gerät. Es dient nur zu Informations- und persönlichen Erkenntniszwecken und ist nicht dazu bestimmt, Erkrankungen zu diagnostizieren, zu behandeln, zu heilen oder zu verhindern. Wende dich für medizinischen Rat an eine Fachperson." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP no es un dispositivo médico. Tiene fines puramente informativos y de análisis personal, y no está diseñado para diagnosticar, tratar, curar o prevenir ninguna enfermedad. Consulta a un médico para recibir asesoramiento." } }
      }
    },
    "NOOP pairs directly with your WHOOP over Bluetooth — no WHOOP app, no cloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP pairs directly with your WHOOP over Bluetooth — no WHOOP app, no cloud." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP koppelt sich direkt über Bluetooth mit deinem WHOOP — keine WHOOP-App, keine Cloud." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP se conecta directamente a tu WHOOP por Bluetooth — sin app de WHOOP, sin la nube." } }
      }
    },
    "NOOP scores your recovery, strain and sleep itself — on-device, no cloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP scores your recovery, strain and sleep itself — on-device, no cloud." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP berechnet deine Erholung, Belastung und deinen Schlaf selbst — auf dem Gerät, ohne Cloud." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP calcula tu recuperación, esfuerzo y sueño por sí mismo — en tu dispositivo, sin la nube." } }
      }
    },
    "NOOP-computed": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "NOOP-computed" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Von NOOP berechnet" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Calculado por NOOP" } }
      }
    },
    "Normalized": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Normalized" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Normalisiert" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Normalizado" } }
      }
    },
    "Normalized overlay": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Normalized overlay" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Normalisierte Überlagerung" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Superposición normalizada" } }
      }
    },
    "Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to WHOOP. Interoperability software for hardware you own and your own data. Use it only with a device you own, and not in breach of any agreement that applies to you. Not a medical device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to WHOOP. Interoperability software for hardware you own and your own data. Use it only with a device you own, and not in breach of any agreement that applies to you. Not a medical device." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Nicht mit WHOOP verbunden, von WHOOP unterstützt oder zu WHOOP gehörend. Interoperabilitätssoftware für Hardware, die dir gehört, und deine eigenen Daten. Nutze sie nur mit einem Gerät, das dir gehört, und nicht unter Verletzung einer für dich geltenden Vereinbarung. Kein medizinisches Gerät." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Sin afiliación, respaldo ni conexión con WHOOP. Software de interoperabilidad para tu propio hardware y tus propios datos. Úsalo solo con un dispositivo de tu propiedad y sin incumplir ningún acuerdo aplicable. No es un dispositivo médico." } }
      }
    },
    "Not enough data for this window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Not enough data for this window." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Nicht genug Daten für diesen Zeitraum." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "No hay suficientes datos para este período." } }
      }
    },
    "Not enough nights yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Not enough nights yet." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Noch nicht genug Nächte." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "No hay suficientes noches todavía." } }
      }
    },
    "Not enough overlapping days between these metrics in %@. Widen the range.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Not enough overlapping days between these metrics in %@. Widen the range." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Nicht genug überlappende Tage zwischen diesen Metriken in %@. Erweitere den Bereich." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "No hay suficientes días en común entre estas métricas en %@. Amplía el rango." } }
      }
    },
    "Not enough overlapping history to correlate your metrics yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Not enough overlapping history to correlate your metrics yet." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Noch nicht genug überlappender Verlauf, um deine Metriken zu korrelieren." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Aún no hay suficiente historial en común para correlacionar tus métricas." } }
      }
    },
    "Not enough recent days to chart a trend yet. Import a history or keep wearing your strap.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Not enough recent days to chart a trend yet. Import a history or keep wearing your strap." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Noch nicht genug aktuelle Tage, um einen Trend darzustellen. Importiere eine Historie oder trage deinen Strap weiter." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Aún no hay suficientes días recientes para mostrar una tendencia. Importa un historial o sigue usando tu pulsera." } }
      }
    },
    "Not synced yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Not synced yet" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Noch nicht synchronisiert" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Aún no se ha sincronizado" } }
      }
    },
    "Nothing imported yet. On an iPhone: Health app, tap your photo, Export All Health Data, then import the .zip here in Data Sources.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Nothing imported yet. On an iPhone: Health app, tap your photo, Export All Health Data, then import the .zip here in Data Sources." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Noch nichts importiert. Auf einem iPhone: Health-App, tippe auf dein Foto, „Alle Gesundheitsdaten exportieren“, dann importiere die .zip hier unter Datenquellen." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Nada importado todavía. En un iPhone: App de Salud, toca tu foto, Exportar todos los datos de salud y luego importa el .zip aquí en Orígenes de datos." } }
      }
    },
    "Nothing in the catalog moves clearly with %@ over this window. Widen the range to surface relationships.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Nothing in the catalog moves clearly with %@ over this window. Widen the range to surface relationships." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Nichts im Katalog bewegt sich in diesem Zeitraum klar mit %@. Erweitere den Bereich, um Zusammenhänge sichtbar zu machen." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Nada en el catálogo muestra un patrón claro con %@ en este período. Amplía el rango para descubrir relaciones." } }
      }
    },
    "Nothing selected yet.": {
      "localizations": {
