      }
    },
    "This builds from the strap as it syncs. Strain and sleep appear after you have worn it and slept a night. Recovery needs about a week of nights to learn your baseline, or import your WHOOP export to skip the wait.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "This builds from the strap as it syncs. Strain and sleep appear after you have worn it and slept a night. Recovery needs about a week of nights to learn your baseline, or import your WHOOP export to skip the wait." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Dies baut sich aus dem Strap auf, während er synchronisiert. Belastung und Schlaf erscheinen, nachdem du ihn getragen und eine Nacht geschlafen hast. Die Erholung braucht etwa eine Woche an Nächten, um deine Basislinie zu lernen, oder importiere deinen WHOOP-Export, um die Wartezeit zu überspringen." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Esto se genera a medida que la pulsera se sincroniza. El esfuerzo y el sueño aparecen tras usarla y dormir una noche. La Recuperación necesita en torno a una semana de noches para aprender tu línea base (puedes importar tu exportación de WHOOP para saltarte la espera)." } }
      }
    },
    "This is the only feature that leaves your Mac — it sends a summary of your metrics to %@ using your own key. Nothing is sent until you ask.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "This is the only feature that leaves your Mac — it sends a summary of your metrics to %@ using your own key. Nothing is sent until you ask." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Dies ist die einzige Funktion, die deinen Mac verlässt — sie sendet eine Zusammenfassung deiner Metriken mit deinem eigenen Schlüssel an %@. Es wird nichts gesendet, bis du es anforderst." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Esta es la única función que sale de tu Mac — envía un resumen de tus métricas a %@ usando tu propia clave. No se envía nada hasta que se lo pidas." } }
      }
    },
    "This stands on community reverse-engineering. Huge thanks:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "This stands on community reverse-engineering. Huge thanks:" } },
