      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "When the system prompt appears, choose Allow so NOOP can find your strap." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Wenn die Systemabfrage erscheint, wähle „Erlauben“, damit NOOP deinen Strap finden kann." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Cuando aparezca el aviso del sistema, elige Permitir para que NOOP pueda encontrar tu pulsera." } }
      }
    },
    "Which strap?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Which strap?" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Welcher Strap?" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "¿Qué pulsera?" } }
      }
    },
    "Whoop": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Whoop" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Whoop" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Whoop" } }
      }
    },
    "Whoop import": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Whoop import" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Whoop-Import" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Importar Whoop" } }
      }
    },
    "WHOOP straps don't appear in macOS System Settings → Bluetooth. They advertise on a custom profile that only apps like NOOP can find — so there's nothing to pair there, and you shouldn't try.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "WHOOP straps don't appear in macOS System Settings → Bluetooth. They advertise on a custom profile that only apps like NOOP can find — so there's nothing to pair there, and you shouldn't try." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "WHOOP-Straps erscheinen nicht in den macOS-Systemeinstellungen → Bluetooth. Sie senden über ein eigenes Profil, das nur Apps wie NOOP finden können — dort gibt es also nichts zu koppeln, und du solltest es nicht versuchen." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Las pulseras WHOOP no aparecen en Ajustes del Sistema de macOS → Bluetooth. Utilizan un perfil personalizado que solo apps como NOOP pueden encontrar, así que no hay nada que emparejar ahí ni deberías intentarlo." } }
      }
    },
    "Window": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Window" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Fenster" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Período" } }
      }
    },
    "With": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "With" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Mit" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Con" } }
      }
    },
    "Without": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Without" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Ohne" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Sin" } }
      }
    },
    "Working…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Working…" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Arbeite…" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Trabajando…" } }
      }
    },
    "Workouts": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Workouts" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Workouts" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Entrenamientos" } }
      }
    },
    "Wrist delivery isn't live yet — it needs a small on-device watcher (coming in an update) to read macOS notifications. Everything stays on this Mac. Your choices are saved now and will apply automatically once delivery ships.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Wrist delivery isn't live yet — it needs a small on-device watcher (coming in an update) to read macOS notifications. Everything stays on this Mac. Your choices are saved now and will apply automatically once delivery ships." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Die Zustellung ans Handgelenk ist noch nicht aktiv — sie benötigt einen kleinen Dienst auf dem Gerät (kommt in einem Update), um macOS-Mitteilungen zu lesen. Alles bleibt auf diesem Mac. Deine Auswahl ist jetzt gespeichert und wird automatisch angewendet, sobald die Zustellung verfügbar ist." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "El envío a la muñeca aún no está disponible — necesita un pequeño servicio en el dispositivo (llegará en una actualización) para leer las notificaciones de macOS. Todo se queda en este Mac. Tus preferencias se guardan ahora y se aplicarán automáticamente cuando la función se lance." } }
      }
    },
    "You said: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "You said: %@" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Du sagtest: %@" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Tú dijiste: %@" } }
      }
    },
    "You're connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "You're connected." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Du bist verbunden." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Estás conectado." } }
      }
    },
    "Your live heart rate is working from the strap, and recovery, strain and sleep build from it over your next few nights of wear, sharpening as it learns your baseline. Want your full history instantly? Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources and it backfills in about a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Your live heart rate is working from the strap, and recovery, strain and sleep build from it over your next few nights of wear, sharpening as it learns your baseline. Want your full history instantly? Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources and it backfills in about a minute." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Deine Live-Herzfrequenz funktioniert über den Strap, und Erholung, Belastung und Schlaf bauen sich daraus über deine nächsten Nächte des Tragens auf und werden schärfer, während er deine Basislinie lernt. Willst du sofort deine vollständige Historie? Importiere deinen WHOOP-Export unter Datenquellen, und er wird in etwa einer Minute nachgefüllt." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "La frecuencia cardíaca en vivo ya funciona desde la pulsera, y tu recuperación, esfuerzo y sueño se calcularán a partir de ella durante tus próximas noches, precisándose al aprender tu línea base. ¿Quieres tu historial completo al instante? Importa tu exportación de WHOOP en Orígenes de datos y se rellenará en un minuto." } }
      }
    },
    "Your numbers, your strap, and how NOOP works. All on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Your numbers, your strap, and how NOOP works. All on this Mac." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Deine Werte, dein Strap und wie NOOP funktioniert. Alles auf diesem Mac." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Tus números, tu pulsera y cómo funciona NOOP. Todo en este Mac." } }
      }
    },
    "Your strap in real time — heart rate and frames as they arrive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Your strap in real time — heart rate and frames as they arrive." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Dein Strap in Echtzeit — Herzfrequenz und Frames, sobald sie eintreffen." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Tu pulsera en tiempo real — frecuencia cardíaca y frames según van llegando." } }
      }
    },
    "Your thread starts here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Your thread starts here." } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Dein Verlauf beginnt hier." } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Tu evolución empieza aquí." } }
      }
    },
    "Zone": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Zone" } },
        "de": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Zone" } },
        "es": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Zona" } }
      }
    },
    "Δ vs prev": {
      "localizations": {
